{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Mysteries of Mhystaria</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every few years, the wandering island of <strong>Mhystaria</strong> rises from the mist. Its impossible ruins and unexplained phenomena attract explorers from all over the world\u2026 but the island never stays for long.<br><strong>What secrets will you uncover before it vanishes again?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a Living, Changing Island</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a retro <strong>2.5D Mode 7\u2013style</strong> world with a unique atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft tools, upgrades, and gear to push deeper into the island.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through biomes filled with ruins, dangerous creatures, and anomalies that defy logic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, build your shelter, and prepare for increasingly ambitious expeditions.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Forge Your Path in the Guild</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on missions from the <strong>Explorers\u2019 Guild</strong> to unlock new areas and rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo\u2026 or team up online with up to <strong>4 players</strong> to explore, collaborate, compete, or face the unknown together.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788870/extras/b3445e1f338acafb132856304915c859.avif?t=1767358143\" width=780 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you enjoy the project, consider adding it to your wishlist. Your support means a lot!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3788870?t=1767358143","background_raw":"https:/